@startuml TITO_SimulationTimeline
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam arrowThickness 2
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FAFAFA

title TITO — Full Simulation Timeline (STREAM-Sat Ensemble Mode)

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' PHASE 0 — COLD START WARMUP (first run only)
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

rectangle "  PHASE 0: Cold-Start Warmup\n  (first run only, x1 per region)\n\n  Forcing: IMERG Early QPE\n  Duration: 3 months\n  Purpose: spin up model states\n  from default initial conditions\n  (NOT ensemble — single run\n   per region, then distributed)  " as warmup #FFE0B2

note top of warmup
  Warmup runs ONCE per region (not per member).
  Warmup states are then distributed to all 50 ensemble members.
  Each member (1..50) then runs Phases A, B1, B2 independently.
end note

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' PHASE A — STREAM-Sat QPE (saves states at end)
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

rectangle "  PHASE A: STREAM-Sat QPE\n  (x50 ensemble members per region)\n\n  Forcing: STREAM-Sat ensemble QPE\n  Window:\n    First run:  Warmup End → T − 4.5h\n    Subsequent: T − 48h → T − 4.5h\n      (STREAM-Sat default 48h window)\n  Timestep: 30 minutes\n  States: SAVED at T − 4.5h\n  (per-member state isolation)  " as phaseA #C8E6C9

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' STATE SAVE POINT
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

rectangle "  STATE SAVE POINT\n  at T − 4.5h\n\n  crest_SM, kwr_IR,\n  kwr_pCQ, kwr_pOQ\n  saved per member  " as state #FF8A80

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' PHASE B1 — STREAM-Sat Gap Fill + GFS Long Range
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

rectangle "  PHASE B1: Gap Fill + GFS QPF\n  (x50 members × GFS)\n\n  Gap: SCaMPR (10-min timestep)\n       T − 4.5h → T\n  QPF: GFS (1-hour timestep)\n       T → T + 24h (or +48h)\n  Starts from Phase A saved states  " as phaseB1 #BBDEFB

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' PHASE B2 — SCaMPR Gap Fill + AROME Long Range
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

rectangle "  PHASE B2: Gap Fill + AROME QPF\n\n  Gap: SCaMPR (10-min timestep)\n       T − 4.5h → T\n  QPF: AROME (1-hour timestep)\n       T → T + 24h (or +48h)\n  Starts from SAME Phase A states\n  (independent from B1)  " as phaseB2 #E1BEE7

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' OUTPUTS
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

rectangle "  OUTPUTS (per member, per region)\n\n  maxq, maxunitq, qpeaccum,\n  qpfaccum, maxsm, maxdepth\n  + timeseries CSV\n  → written to outputs/<region>/  " as outputs #FFF9C4

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' FLOW ARROWS
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

warmup -right-> phaseA : Warmup states distributed\nto each ensemble member

phaseA -right-> state : States saved at T − 4.5h\n(per member)

state -down-> phaseB1 : Resume from\nsaved states
state -down-> phaseB2 : Resume from\nsaved states\n(independent path)

phaseB1 -right-> outputs
phaseB2 -right-> outputs

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' TIMELINE BAR (visual summary at bottom)
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

note bottom of outputs #E8EAF6
  **Timeline Summary** (horizontal axis = time)
  
  | warmup |  STREAM-Sat QPE  |S| Gap fill |  GFS QPF   |
  | warmup |  STREAM-Sat QPE  |S| Gap fill | AROME QPF  |
  | 6h     |  30-min timestep |T| 10-min   | 1h timestep|
  |(1st run|  T-10h ... T-4.5h|A| T-4.5..T | T..T+24/48h|
  | only)  |                  |T|          |            |
  |        |                  |E|          |            |
  
  **Key:**
  * All phases run in parallel per ensemble member (x50) per region (x5)
  * Phase B1 (GFS) and B2 (AROME) are independent — both start from same Phase A state
  * Subsequent cycles: skip warmup, start directly from Phase A with prior saved states
  * Gap fill bridges the IMERG latency window (T-4.5h to T) using real-time data
end note

@enduml
